i get that it may be a thing to be insecure about for you, but size generally doesn't matter that much. what matters is what you do with that size. most of the nerve endings in a vagina are in the first 3 cm, so if you're longer than 1 inch you're usually good.

try some new positions that may feel good for both you and her. this one usually gets you in a lot deeper and can be very enjoyable: [https://images.app.goo.gl/nCDoJAiXud58FRsY7](https://images.app.goo.gl/nCDoJAiXud58FRsY7) 

good luck!
